  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEO: DataFest Tbilisi &#x2013; Conference Costs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DataFest Tbilisi is the largest annual data and AI event in Eastern Europe and the South Caucasus, gathering over 1,000 participants from business, technology, media, academia, and civil society. This project will support the participation of leading British AI and data experts at DataFest Tbilisi 2025 to strengthen professional connections between the UK and Georgian AI communities.
Through keynotes, panels, and workshops, British speakers will share best practices in artificial intelligence, data science, and responsible innovation, fostering direct knowledge transfer and collaboration. Structured networking activities will help establish long-term partnerships, mentorships, and joint initiatives between UK and Georgian professionals.</narrative>
  </description>
